represents the latest stable release within the `3.2.x` line, which is a safe bet.

So, my plan is to reinstate the `spring-boot-starter-parent` to `3.2.11`. This time, if I encounter the same build failure with `spring-boot-starter-webmvc` not resolving, I'll explicitly
