Finally, I'll **re-run `validate-remediation`**. This is my final check to confirm that the entire remediation process has been successful and that all aspects of the build and security 
posture are where they should be.

Right, I'll proceed with adding `spring-boot-starter-webmvc` to the root `pom.xml` now.

